            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "The kitchen, or non-volley zone, extends 7 feet from the net on each side and runs the full 20-foot width of the court. The kitchen line is part of the zone, so a player touching it while volleying commits a fault. Measure to the outside edge of the line."
